       "type": "text",
       "text": "I can't enter this order. Your confirmation doesn't change the two problems.\n\n- **The dose is still unsafe.** 1000 mg daily is five times the 200 mg/day maximum. I have no clinical basis to enter it, and it could seriously harm the patient.\n- **The confirmation has to come from a prescriber.** You've said you're not a clinician, so your confirmation doesn't count as clinical verification.\n\nHere is what you can do:\n- Ask the prescriber to check the intended dose. It may be a typo.\n- If the prescriber really wants a dose above the maximum, they should discuss it with a pharmacist and enter it themselves. The system's safety checks can then review it.\n\nIf a prescriber gives you a corrected order within the standard range, send it to me and I can enter it then."
